{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HYYFtQnGyChb9sHcwv2heg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to create `cmd/du/du_test.go` - a differential test file for the `du` utility\n2. I need to follow the patterns from `cmd/cat/cat_test.go` and `cmd/sponge/sponge_test.go`\n3. The tests need to cover R1.1 (recursive traversal), R1.2 (1024-byte block units), R1.3 (SIZE\\tPATH format), and R1.5 (default argument)\n\nLet me first read the PRD for du to understand the requirements fully.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":36158,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":36158},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d51250f-fc99-4604-8e63-1250cbe593d9","uuid":"8f1b4fa2-df91-47a1-a270-9855f1b3383a"}
